{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_004_03_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3bf446d55f40d76667707ee45a401d81d9c0b5d013098243151e938f373d4c18",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a641b7db95e069820cee1141a157e3f5e598505f59c69b420f38fc180e23b50",
      "text": "恭二的公寓",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d965b3dfcdd010d781d5b6617cca975d1b95774fc8d91e54262d43c4aa165f28",
      "text": "……学历和工作经历这样就行了吧。\n惨了，写错字了……重新写一张吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30a8b550ceeadbb34b90a060532999a8ed7fe31022122c4f77e35b8ac154bd1d",
      "text": "（话说回来，实先生。虽然早就知道他喜欢偶像……\n但没想到他了解得这么透彻）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74843d7901469cdb54c5cbfac4ed80344b99be4aeb8e745c5cf5e022852fb892",
      "text": "（关于偶像的种类啦、挑事务所之类的事。\n要是只有我和皮埃尔，肯定会更头疼）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d47f12927885ded124c50576b92904d885f903a3be1a9a61ea1b7674f1cb9cf",
      "text": "……说起来，实先生为什么\n会那么喜欢偶像呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7af996df9241d04d16bb998b0c31e0ce00cc62a686a0a3238898eb772256ac5",
      "text": "……仔细想想，我……\n其实并不怎么了解那个人的过去啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b091dcf4caa753ae9614cf32787b13607708ac24ed2ef91725b6167efd884e56",
      "text": "（在花店工作，脸上总是挂着笑容。\n虽然一直看到的都是这副样子……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b75d25c57f3d85076bee8981f1527a7356c4446e71f77d71c56003b364dc3079",
      "text": "在遇到我们之前，他是做什么的呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78d227f2b82173911592ea4e8f1ef175b3b59ce5e27ccf81a9bebe5d0683684d",
      "text": "（……不。说到底，我们三个人之间，\n本来就有很多彼此不知道的事）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d82ee70aa9006ea404b3bc7c2b9eca8cf7d25c164afc3dc4ffe5071fda8937b",
      "text": "（我不愿意提家里的事，皮埃尔也\n不管怎么看都满身是谜。现在才想这些也太迟了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08933aa0ca3a1c378746c50ef2e2eec6d269adb0b9d039dc03ab27c152603e81",
      "text": "（即使如此……他们也是很好相处的好人）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27f0907a92a541a39fd04db5dbcead96ecead9ddac9006bc107de9fc9467aa72",
      "text": "好了。别发呆了，\n赶紧把自己的简历写完吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
